  "$comment": "The module tree of aifn-engine. Compute (package aifn-compute): families in tiers, each with modules in local tiers and optional shared files at the family root; a module imports lower families, lower-tier modules of its own family, and its family's shared files. Applications (package aifn-methods): areas with nested groups and modules; a group's shared files serve its children; siblings share only through the parent; areas import others only down dependsOn. status \"gap\" marks a planned node with no code. aliases list old paths kept as re-export barrels during a move. Read by scripts/layers.ts (the lint and the README tables), scripts/package.ts and the tests.",
